 ns: 2026-05-15\nEarly registration: 2026-06-30\nPresenter registration d
 eadline: 2026-07-30\n\nhttps://marceconference2026.com/
LOCATION:Cape Town\, Western Cape\, ZA\, Century City Conference Centre
URL:https://marceconference2026.com/
